1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:01,280
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:03,892
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,892 --> 00:00:04,920
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:08,040
=Episode 14=

5
00:00:32,039 --> 00:00:32,920
Why so nervous?

6
00:00:36,079 --> 00:00:36,960
Are you worried

7
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:39,119
I'll do something to you at work?

8
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:43,359
That's not what I meant.

9
00:00:45,479 --> 00:00:47,039
You're a gentleman, Mr. Xie.

10
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:48,479
You wouldn't do anything to me.

11
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:52,479
I just mean

12
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:56,240
you haven't eaten the food I brought.

13
00:01:00,439 --> 00:01:00,960
You're wrong.

14
00:01:05,519 --> 00:01:06,159
Sometimes,

15
00:01:09,560 --> 00:01:11,000
I'm no gentleman.

16
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:15,440
♪Hold me tight. Don't let me go♪

17
00:01:15,640 --> 00:01:18,560
♪Let me fall into your hidden river♪

18
00:01:18,800 --> 00:01:21,720
♪If this fire is destined to go wrong♪

19
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:24,840
♪I'll bear the pain so I remember♪

20
00:01:26,079 --> 00:01:27,640
(Xie Zhouhan is so bold.)

21
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:29,560
(In the elevator, of all places.)

22
00:01:30,439 --> 00:01:32,400
(The cameras must have caught us.)

23
00:01:36,319 --> 00:01:36,959
Hua,

24
00:01:41,239 --> 00:01:42,319
Dad didn't give you a hard time, did he?

25
00:01:44,120 --> 00:01:45,040
No.

26
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:46,879
We just talked for a bit.

27
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:51,799
He didn't mention Gu at all?

28
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:54,719
Why do you ask?

29
00:01:58,079 --> 00:01:59,159
As long as he didn't ask.

30
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:02,640
He really is good to you.

31
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:03,480
He trusts you.

32
00:02:04,599 --> 00:02:05,599
That's a relief.

33
00:02:07,439 --> 00:02:09,800
What goes on in that head of yours?

34
00:02:17,759 --> 00:02:18,199
Hua,

35
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:19,520
can we talk?

36
00:02:20,919 --> 00:02:21,840
Talk...

37
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:23,120
Well,

38
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:25,639
if Dad wants to talk to you,

39
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:27,319
I'll stop being a third wheel.

40
00:02:27,599 --> 00:02:28,039
Hua,

41
00:02:28,159 --> 00:02:29,319
I'm sleepy. I'm off to bed.

42
00:02:29,719 --> 00:02:30,919
Wait, Bao'er.

43
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:36,719
Mr. Xie,

44
00:02:37,199 --> 00:02:38,400
are you and Bao'er hiding something

45
00:02:38,479 --> 00:02:39,080
from me?

46
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:43,520
Want to know?

47
00:02:44,199 --> 00:02:44,879
I'll tell you later.

48
00:02:48,320 --> 00:02:50,280
♪Get close to her♪

49
00:02:51,480 --> 00:02:53,440
♪Kiss her♪

50
00:02:53,919 --> 00:02:54,840
(I'm so happy today.)

51
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:58,240
♪Close to my heart♪

52
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:03,360
♪I want to get a little closer♪

53
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:04,840
♪A little closer still♪

54
00:03:05,040 --> 00:03:07,120
♪Hear her breathing♪

55
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:08,360
♪Right beside my ear♪

56
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,840
♪Her shadow sways♪

57
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:11,439
I... I'm sleepy.

58
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:12,280
I want to go to bed.

59
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:13,440
♪The more I try to stay calm♪

60
00:03:13,640 --> 00:03:15,240
♪She sets me alight so easily♪

61
00:03:15,480 --> 00:03:16,760
♪Don't ask about the future♪

62
00:03:16,920 --> 00:03:18,640
♪Don't ask me why♪

63
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:20,240
♪No need to make it obvious♪

64
00:03:20,440 --> 00:03:21,840
♪No need for words♪

65
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:25,240
This is the place, right?

66
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:26,480
I've got the right address.

67
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:29,040
That car...

68
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:30,840
Now that's something.

69
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:36,520
Hello, Ms. Lin.

70
00:03:36,920 --> 00:03:37,640
Your medicine is here.

71
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:38,680
I'm at the gate.

72
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:39,840
Could you come get it?

73
00:03:40,720 --> 00:03:41,120
Okay.

74
00:03:42,760 --> 00:03:43,760
Okay, sure.

75
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:46,720
Hello. Give me the medicine, please.

76
00:03:46,921 --> 00:03:47,560
I'm her husband.

77
00:03:49,441 --> 00:03:49,720
Sure.

78
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:50,800
I'll give it to your husband, then.

79
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:51,600
Okay.

80
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:52,600
Right. Bye.

81
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:54,119
Have a lovely day, sir.

82
00:03:54,399 --> 00:03:54,600
Bye.

83
00:03:54,719 --> 00:03:55,160
Bye.

84
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:13,959
Did he tell you everything?

85
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:18,880
Well, Mr. Xie,

86
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:20,440
um...

87
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:25,680
Last night,

88
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,519
you didn't use a condom.
We didn't have any pills,

89
00:04:28,599 --> 00:04:29,599
so I ordered some.

90
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:33,839
Don't worry.

91
00:04:34,880 --> 00:04:36,000
This is a contract marriage.

92
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:38,080
I won't cause that kind of trouble.

93
00:04:40,839 --> 00:04:41,399
You're...

94
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:44,919
very considerate.

95
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:49,479
Then let's not waste those pills.

96
00:04:54,440 --> 00:04:56,680
(Why's Xie Zhouhan suddenly changed?)

97
00:04:57,320 --> 00:04:59,399
(He was so sweet and caring before.)

98
00:04:59,839 --> 00:05:02,359
(Now he can't get enough.)

99
00:05:13,839 --> 00:05:15,959
Dancing with male escorts last night?

100
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:17,519
You look exhausted.

101
00:05:23,719 --> 00:05:24,680
No.

102
00:05:26,399 --> 00:05:28,320
I was up late working.

103
00:05:31,320 --> 00:05:32,320
So dedicated?

104
00:05:36,080 --> 00:05:37,760
Any progress on your project?

105
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,359
Gu Group called.

106
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,839
They'll let the mistake slide

107
00:05:42,200 --> 00:05:43,240
and work with us

108
00:05:43,320 --> 00:05:44,599
on a revised plan.

109
00:05:45,919 --> 00:05:47,959
Did you talk to Mr. Gu

110
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:49,599
and put in a good word for me?

111
00:05:55,880 --> 00:05:56,839
It was nothing.

112
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,000
Don't worry about it.

113
00:05:58,719 --> 00:06:00,039
Nothing?

114
00:06:00,519 --> 00:06:01,760
You've done so much for me.

115
00:06:02,039 --> 00:06:02,719
I won't forget

116
00:06:03,359 --> 00:06:03,839
what I owe you.

117
00:06:05,159 --> 00:06:06,640
From now on, in Design,

118
00:06:08,039 --> 00:06:09,519
I've got your back.

119
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:12,080
Here.

120
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:32,000
♪You say you♪

121
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:34,000
♪Don't need anyone♪
(Signature page, Party A Xie Zhouhan)

122
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:37,400
♪You're just fine on your own♪

123
00:06:37,720 --> 00:06:40,560
♪I see the pride behind your smile♪

124
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:43,560
♪And the pain you face at night♪

125
00:06:44,320 --> 00:06:47,240
♪Sometimes love isn't about possession♪

126
00:06:47,640 --> 00:06:50,400
♪It's tenderness that sets you free♪

127
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:53,480
♪Some love needs no promises♪

128
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:56,840
♪I'll face this cold world with you♪

129
00:06:56,920 --> 00:06:59,520
♪I keep my feelings safely hidden♪

130
00:06:59,640 --> 00:07:02,760
♪Quietly staying behind you♪

131
00:07:02,960 --> 00:07:05,720
♪I'm right behind you♪

132
00:07:06,080 --> 00:07:09,240
♪Shielding you from every hidden storm♪

133
00:07:09,320 --> 00:07:11,880
♪Keeping the rain out of your eyes♪

134
00:07:11,880 --> 00:07:15,880
♪So you can walk ahead without fear♪

135
00:07:18,880 --> 00:07:22,080
♪I'm right behind you♪

136
00:07:22,240 --> 00:07:23,960
♪Waiting for you to turn around♪

137
00:07:24,080 --> 00:07:25,800
♪Waiting for you to finally see♪

138
00:07:25,880 --> 00:07:28,240
♪You're the only one I lose control for♪

139
00:07:28,440 --> 00:07:29,800
♪I'm right behind you♪

140
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:32,160
♪Loving you gently, though no one knows♪

141
00:07:32,280 --> 00:07:33,920
♪I won't claim you♪

142
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:35,600
♪I won't ask you to stay♪

143
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:38,280
♪I'll spend the rest of my life♪

144
00:07:39,320 --> 00:07:41,640
♪Waiting for you♪
